#basePath P1_Hub
#include "Header.leaf"

:: Entry
@exposed
// Mark start of phase
$set global:currentPhase = 1

{@}   
       // [This is the entry hub for Phase 1.]
$call DisableMapButton()
$call EnableMapButton()
$call UnlockLocation(ResearchLab)  // P1_Lamprey

// TODO: Rest of entry hub here


:: Continue
@exposed

{@}   
       // [This is the continue hub for Phase 1.]
$call EnableMapButton()

// TODO: Rest of continue hub here

// if all Phase 1 threads have been visited, exit
$if HasSeen(P1_NativeLamprey.End), HasSeen(P1_Lamprey.End)
        $goto .Exit
$endif


:: Exit
@exposed

$call  ClearVisibleLines()
{@}   
       You've learned a little bit about Lamprey.
       You've also obtained one strategy that will help address the issue.
       Well done!
       Take some time to prepare yourself for whatever will come your way next.
       [End of Demo]
      // [This is the exit hub for Phase 1.]

// TODO: Rest of exit hub here

// Go to Phase 2 Hub
// $goto   P2_Hub.Entry